# turret-barrel - rotating gun for turret-base. 8x16, 1 frame, straight top-down, points UP (engine rotates).
# Pivot = frame centre (4,8 in pixel-edge coords): the 8px hub occupies rows 4-11, cols 0-7.
# light: top-left (engine rotation will turn it; shading kept mild and mostly radial-safe).
# Parts: muzzle brake (rows 0-2), barrel (rows 2-4), hub with 2x2 red sight, breech counterweight (rows 11-14).
# Palette: olive a b c d e, red n r, K.
palette
. transparent
K #0b0d1a  outline
b #31443a  olive-1
c #4f6852  olive-2
d #7e9a78  olive-3
e #b9cfa2  olive-4
n #92203a  red-1
r #da3d4f  red-2
ramp olive b c d e
ramp red n r
